    <string name="set_surya_desc">Sun salutation: 77 positions, wide steps and three-point planks. Strength, stamina, full-body warm-up.</string>
    <string name="set_chandra_desc">Moon salutation: 99 positions, inner rings on all fours. Spine and hip mobility, gentler on the legs.</string>
    <string name="set_bundle_desc">Both salutations back to back without exit and new entry, as the method prescribes. A long full workout.</string>
    <string name="set_morning_desc">Standard entry, one vinyasa and exit. For busy days or rest days.</string>
